      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOVERING (3) goes very well this trip starting 15 times for five wins and three minors. Was out of placings last time (22.88) at Bulli in a Grade 4/5, finishing fourth and beaten 6 lengths. Looks well placed and should feature. WOOPI EXPRESS (7) turned in a moderate effort last time when sixth at The Gardens over 400m behind Top Bin Nismo (24.21) in a Grade 5. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. AUTUMN BOY (8) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (23.55) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Better than last start and can bounce back. KAVA QUEEN (2) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
